faqs.a:
This Division has been established with the following purposes intended:
  1.	Promote the public health, safety, and welfare by minimizing flood losses and the inconvenience and damage resulting from uncontrolled and unplanned stormwater runoff in the City;
  2.	Minimize increases in stormwater runoff as a result of development;
  3.	Reduce pollutants in stormwater discharges from construction activity;
  4.	Minimize increases in non-point source pollution cause by stormwater runoff;
  5.	Reduce flooding, siltation, stream bank erosion, and channel degradation; and
  6.	Ensure that stormwater management controls are properly maintained.
(Ord. No. 4867, § 2, 2-12-2024)
